1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,476
Look at sulphuric acid and sodium hydroxide.

2
00:00:03,476 --> 00:00:08,411
One mole of acid needs two moles of base, so the moles do not match.

3
00:00:08,411 --> 00:00:16,705
But one mole of sulphuric acid carries two equivalents, and two moles of sodium hydroxide carry two equivalents.

4
00:00:16,705 --> 00:00:19,401
The equivalents match exactly.

